"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m033-0015","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p033","quote":"棁"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m033-0124","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p033","quote":"棁"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m033-0154","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p033","quote":"棁"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m033-0177","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p033","quote":"棁"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m033-0179","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p033","quote":"棁"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m033-0195","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p033","quote":"棁"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m033-0321","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p033","quote":"棁"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","source_id":"s-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p033","quote":"初，憲王舜有所不愛姬生長男棁。棁以母無寵故，亦不得幸於王。王後修生太子勃。王內多，所幸姬生子平、子商，王后希得幸。及憲王病甚，諸幸姬常侍病，故王后亦以妒媢不常侍病，輒歸舍。醫進藥，太子勃不自嘗藥，又不宿留侍病。及王薨，王后、太子乃至。憲王雅不以長子棁為人數，及薨，又不分與財物。郎或說太子、王后，令諸子與長子棁共分財物，太子、王后不聽。太子代立，又不收恤棁。棁怨王后、太子。漢使者視憲王喪，棁自言憲王病時，王后、太子不侍，及薨，六日出舍，太子勃私姦，飲酒，博戲，擊筑，與女子載馳，環城過市，入牢視囚。天子遣大行騫驗王后及問王勃，請逮勃所與姦諸證左，王又匿之。吏求捕勃大急，使人致擊笞掠，擅出漢所疑囚者。有司請誅憲王後修及王勃。上以修素無行，使棁陷之罪，勃無良師傅，不忍誅。有司請廢王後修，徙王勃以家屬處房陵，上許之。","source_term":"憲王舜有所不愛姬生長男棁"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji059-040","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"1c8_u63_bk4_M"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p003624"]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-059-wuzong","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-059","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","mention_count":8,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-059-wuzong:m033-0013","c-shiji